{"study_accession":"PRJEB40936","secondary_study_accession":"ERP124649","title":"Predictive biomarkers for responsiveness to FOLFOX in gastric cancers based on integrative profiling of patient-derived xenografts","description":"Gastric cancer (GC) is the second leading cause of cancer-associated death worldwide. Curative surgery followed by systemic chemotherapy containing 5-fluorouracil (5-FU) derivatives and platinum combination chemotherapy is the standard of care for GC patients. However, there is a lack of the clinically applicable predictors of FOLFOX (folinic acid, 5-FU and oxaliplatin) combination chemotherapy. Herein, we developed patient-derived xenograft (PDX) models from 31 GC patients treated with combination of 5-FU and oxaliplatin to provide predictive biomarkers for drug responsiveness based on extensive genomic and transcriptomic characterization of chemotherapy responsiveness of tumors.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":13,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMEA7483035","study_accession":"PRJEB40936","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"SJ-G222","description":"blood","sex":"","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2020-10-28","attributes":[["ENA-CHECKLIST","ERC000011"],["ENA-FIRST-PUBLIC","2020-10-27T17:05:21Z"],["organism","Homo sapiens"],["ENA-LAST-UPDATE","2020-10-23T02:13:07Z"],["scientific_name","Homo sapiens"],["common name","human"],["ENA-FIRST-PUBLIC","2020-10-27"],["ENA-LAST-UPDATE","2020-10-23"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"ERR4766068","experiment_accession":"ERX4637719","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2000","read_count":124303782,"base_count":12554681982,"first_public":"2020-10-28","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2000 paired end sequencing"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMEA7483038","study_accession":"PRJEB40936","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"SJ-G187","description":"blood","sex":"","geo_sa